# FinMind clone — Taiwan daily-ingest cron (host crontab snippet).
#
# Phase A' runs the self-crawl ingest directly against TWSE/MOPS/TAIFEX/
# TDCC/FRED. `run_due` is idempotent + resume-safe: it only fetches
# datasets whose freshness budget has lapsed (dispatcher.is_due), so
# running it often is cheap and a missed slot self-heals on the next tick.
#
# INSTALL (host, one-time — this file is committed as reference, NOT
# auto-installed):
#
#   docker compose exec backend true   # sanity: container up
#   crontab -l > /tmp/cur ; cat backend/finmind/deploy/finmind-cron >> /tmp/cur ; crontab /tmp/cur
#
# All times are the HOST timezone. The container runs UTC internally but
# `run_due` keys off data freshness, not wall-clock, so the schedule below
# is a "poke often around the TWSE publish times" pattern, not a hard gate.
#
# Rate limiting: every self-crawl request goes through the shared
# ~1 req/s Redis token bucket (data/tw/twse_connector), so overlapping
# ticks + any backfill automatically serialise against TWSE. Safe to
# leave running alongside a deep_backfill.

# ── Daily incremental (weekday, staggered around publish times) ──
# 15:10 — price/volume settle after the 13:30 close.
10 15 * * 1-5  cd /opt/finceptweb99 && docker compose exec -T backend python -m finmind.scripts.run_due --universe-from-tw-stock-info >> /var/log/finmind-run-due.log 2>&1
# 17:30 — institutional / margin / securities-lending land late afternoon.
30 17 * * 1-5  cd /opt/finceptweb99 && docker compose exec -T backend python -m finmind.scripts.run_due --universe-from-tw-stock-info >> /var/log/finmind-run-due.log 2>&1
# 22:00 — derivatives (TAIFEX after-hours) + any weekly/monthly rollups.
0 22 * * 1-5   cd /opt/finceptweb99 && docker compose exec -T backend python -m finmind.scripts.run_due --universe-from-tw-stock-info >> /var/log/finmind-run-due.log 2>&1

# ── Macro (FRED) — publishes on US schedule; a nightly poke is plenty ──
30 6 * * *     cd /opt/finceptweb99 && docker compose exec -T backend python -m finmind.scripts.run_due --skip-per-symbol >> /var/log/finmind-run-due.log 2>&1
